<ns0:note style="-uslm-lc:I75" topic="referencesInText" id="idb9beb143-47c4-11f1-9a61-b1559996dfe8">
<ns0:heading class="centered smallCaps">References in Text</ns0:heading><ns0:p style="-uslm-lc:I21" class="indent0">Rule 37 of the Federal Rules of Criminal Procedure was abrogated <ns0:date date="1967-12-04">Dec. 4, 1967</ns0:date>, eff. <ns0:date date="1968-07-01">July 1, 1968</ns0:date>. Provisions of such former rule for certiorari are covered by rule 19 et seq. of the Rules of the United States Supreme Court.</ns0:p>
</ns0:note>
